  <!-- EN: a dead sarlacc -->
  <sw_DeadSarlaccCave.label>死掉的沙拉克</sw_DeadSarlaccCave.label>
  <!-- EN: This area hosts a dead sarlacc creature. These sessile creatures are known to have millenia long lifespans, but are ultimately mortal. Whether from disease, starvation, burrowing insectoids or even old age they eventually die and leave a cavern where the bulk of their corpse has rotted away. -->
  <sw_DeadSarlaccCave.description>这个区域有一只死去的沙拉克生物。众所周知，这些无梗生物的寿命长达千年之久，但最终也难逃一死。无论是疾病、饥饿、穴居昆虫，甚至是衰老，它们最终都会死去，并在洞穴中留下大量腐烂的尸体。</sw_DeadSarlaccCave.description>
  <!-- EN: sarlacc pit -->
  <sw_SarlaccLair.label>沙拉克坑</sw_SarlaccLair.label>
  <!-- EN: This area hosts a juvenile sarlacc creature. These sessile creatures are known to have millenia long lifespans, the circular maws on the surface are supported by a massive undergorund body. -->
  <sw_SarlaccLair.description>这个区域栖息着一种幼年的沙拉克生物。众所周知，这些无梗生物的寿命长达数千年，表面的圆形巨口由巨大的底部躯体支撑。</sw_SarlaccLair.description>
</LanguageData>
